{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"You hear a voice in your mind, one of a proud woman. One holding an immense power that it keeps controlled. They are commanding, but not without merciful tones","created_at":"2020-07-27T19:16:20.129000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737387919983116408","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"||Your bloodline is not something to worry about dear Astella. It is what you choose to do and pair with your intentions. The face you show the world, in opposition to that which you hold in your heart. In your past, you manipulated and schemed, you come here and are thrown into a lot that does not care of your high born origin and it gives you a fresh start, but have you changed? State your intentions||","created_at":"2020-07-27T19:18:32.322000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737388474440876044","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"Astella ponders","created_at":"2020-07-27T19:19:05.987000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737388615641989270","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"||To live equal to those around me. To further the study of science and spread the embrace of inventions around the world. To create order, but one that is just and pays and rewards all those who deserve it equally. To atone for my divisive power by taking children under my wing, and by helping a people start anew with whatever they need. And finally, to protect a legacy written in compassion. A legacy not of Cosimo, not of Galileo, but of me.||","created_at":"2020-07-27T19:22:31.926000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737389479412891709","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"736489917806542878","content":"||Your intentions are clear show signs of purity. Yet your actions show another story. I see in you the desire to be selfless and show others that you are so. But, in doing so you impose your will in front of others. You hold your inventions to be your pride and place it above the efforts of others much to their condemnation. You are ignorant of your own actions and words that place yourself in front of others working through their conflict. An attempt to help by your intentions, but a detriment to their free will. These actions are not selfless in nature and do not provide for the needs of others. You may come back when you realize and change your perspective to truly help others in their struggle rather than doing it yourself. For this.. I judge you.. ***Unworthy***||","created_at":"2020-07-27T19:27:35.061000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737390750853234819","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
